WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A twelve-minute pause may fit into a busy day.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
But short listening is not automatically equivalent to advanced meditation.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The Zen12 seller makes that comparison. It needs product-specific evidence.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
A systematic review of binaural beats found inconsistent results.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Compare a few free twelve-minute listening routines first.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Read the sources, check the privacy terms, and decide for yourself.
